# Binary by content. `-text` blocks CRLF/LF normalization (which would
# corrupt the file), `-diff` tells `git diff` / `git log -p` not to
# dump 800 KB of garbled bytes when these change. PDFs are rebuilt by
# `just examples`; TTFs are vendored under `mos-fonts/data/`
# (see SOURCES.md for upstream provenance).
*.pdf  -text -diff
*.ttf  -text -diff
